  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Iraq OfD cooperation 2019 -2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to OfD programme implementation in Iraq. The in-kind grant agreement comprises institutional cooperation within the resource and environment components of the oil for development programme. The program duration period is 2019 to 2022 with a possibility for a subsequent no-cost extension period. Implementing institutions in Iraq are the Ministry of Oil and the Ministry of Health and Environment. The initiative is based on a flexible program approach that may be adjusted to the political and security developments in Iraq.</narrative>
  </description>
